endent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"id":"name-jin064-lv_yong","person_id":"stn_738_b7j","surname":"呂","ming":"雍","additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014:m0370","source_full_name":"呂雍","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014","start":370,"end":372,"surface":"呂雍"},"quote":"及沖太孫薨，齊王冏表曰：「東宮曠然，塚嗣莫繼。天下大業，帝王神器，必建儲副，以固洪基。今者後宮未有孕育，不可庶幸將來而虛天緒，非祖宗之遺志，社稷之長計也。禮，兄弟之子猶子，故漢成無嗣，繼由定陶；孝和之絕，安以紹興。此先王之令典，往代之成式也。清河王覃神姿岐嶷，慧智早成，康王正妃周氏所生，先帝眾孫之中，於今為嫡。昔薄姬賢明，文則承位。覃外祖恢世載名德，覃宜奉宗廟之重，統無窮之祚，以甯四海顒顒之望。覃兄弟雖並出紹，可簡令淑還為國胤，不替其嗣。輒諮大將軍穎及群公卿士，咸同大願。請具禮儀，擇日迎拜。」遂立覃為皇太子。既而河間王顒協遷大駕，表成都王穎為皇太弟，廢覃復為清河王。初，覃為清河世子，所佩金鈴欻生隱起如麻粟，祖母陳太妃以為不祥，毀而賣之。占者以金是晉行大興之祥，覃為皇胤，是其瑞也。毀而賣之，象覃見廢不終之驗也。永嘉初，前北軍中候任城呂雍、度支校尉陳顏等謀立覃為太子，事覺，幽于金墉城。未幾，被害，時年十四，葬以庶人禮。","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-ws2622004-rendered-wudi-sons"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014:m0370","start":370,"end":372,"surface":"呂雍","kind":"person","person_id":"stn_738_b7j","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"lv_yong","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_nor